WEBVTT

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:07.360
Infinite Ryvius

00:00:13.210 --> 00:00:15.040
I know, Mom.

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:17.410
It's all right, there's no need to worry.

00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:19.780
Level 2 Qualifications Manual Kouji Aiba
I'll call you the minute something happens.

00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:20.620
I'll call you the minute something happens.

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:23.410
But if I do, I'm calling you collect.

00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:26.820
Oh, one other thing.

00:00:26.820 --> 00:00:28.720
Tell Yuki not to go into my room.

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:30.520
I don't want him messing it up.

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:32.160
So don't forget.

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:39.470
No, I don't need you to see me off,
I'm not a little kid.

00:00:40.030 --> 00:00:43.070
You're the one that said I'd get teased
if my parents got overprotective.

00:00:43.070 --> 00:00:45.330
Allowance?
Okay, thanks.

00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:48.610
I really should get going.

00:00:49.140 --> 00:00:49.680
Aiba: Ritsuko, Kouji and Yuki

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:51.080
Aiba: Ritsuko, Kouji and Yuki
See ya.

00:00:56.050 --> 00:00:58.150
Sheesh...

00:00:58.150 --> 00:01:03.390
<i>Shibamata Express arriving on track 4
<i>is leaving at 10:14 for Tokyo Airport.</i></i>

00:01:03.820 --> 00:01:08.420
<i>All passengers riding this train</i>
<i>please board immediately.</i>

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:15.330
<i>Shibamata Express is now departing.</i>
<i>Please refrain from boarding now.</i>

00:01:16.070 --> 00:01:18.400
Phew, I finally found you.

00:01:19.810 --> 00:01:22.510
I looked all over for you
thinking you were in the rear cars.

00:01:22.510 --> 00:01:23.740
Hey! Wait!

00:01:23.740 --> 00:01:26.080
- What?
- What do you mean, "what"?

00:01:29.220 --> 00:01:31.280
Aoi. What are you doing here, anyway?

00:01:31.790 --> 00:01:33.350
What am I doing here?

00:01:33.350 --> 00:01:35.250
I've also been accepted to go.

00:01:36.290 --> 00:01:39.950
Your Mom knows,
she asked me to look out for you and Yuki.

00:01:40.330 --> 00:01:43.160
Yuki?! He's going too?

00:01:43.630 --> 00:01:45.360
Yes. The same Level Two.

00:01:45.930 --> 00:01:47.160
Darn!

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:51.610
Why the hell...?

00:01:51.610 --> 00:01:53.210
Hey, Kouji.

00:01:53.210 --> 00:01:54.710
What now?

00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:56.140
Those clothes don't suit you.

00:01:57.810 --> 00:01:59.950
Is that so?

00:01:59.950 --> 00:02:01.820
So what, I wear what I wanna wear.

00:02:01.820 --> 00:02:16.530
From an endless sorrow to somewhere else

00:02:16.600 --> 00:02:20.290
Infinite Ryvius

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:27.910
If you're going to walk, right here will be fine

00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:31.910
Although loneliness...

00:02:31.910 --> 00:02:36.250
...can sometimes be unbearable

00:02:36.750 --> 00:02:43.490
There's the benefit of not hurting anyone...

00:02:44.630 --> 00:02:48.560
...and the benefit of not being exposed...

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:51.530
...and hurt by others as well

00:02:52.030 --> 00:02:59.060
At the opposite side of the frozen sea...

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:02.840
...the dream and the reality...

00:03:02.840 --> 00:03:06.470
...that you saw cross paths

00:03:06.650 --> 00:03:10.170
Some light is shed...

00:03:10.850 --> 00:03:14.760
...but how it is done is unknown...

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:21.990
...so that we can go to a different place

00:03:22.460 --> 00:03:30.000
The things I want have no shape

00:03:30.270 --> 00:03:38.410
Tear the final universe, today until tomorrow

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:52.390
The Forthcoming Time

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:56.960
Astronaut Training Center, Liebe Delta.

00:03:57.830 --> 00:04:03.270
One month has passed since I came here
to obtain my Level Two Navigator License.

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:09.040
We've arrived at the ordered operation point,
32 seconds behind estimated arrival time.

00:04:09.480 --> 00:04:13.010
Geduld has caused the temperature
of the outer walls...

00:04:13.010 --> 00:04:16.480
...to increase to 670 Anvils above normal,
but it is within adjustable range.

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:19.150
Activity time three-five-double-zero.

00:04:19.520 --> 00:04:23.220
Roger, roger. While we're at it,
let's decide on our target as well.

00:04:23.220 --> 00:04:25.050
Let's do the large one diagonally below us.

00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:29.860
This one? We only have sixty-seven before
we reach our Sere one limit.

00:04:29.860 --> 00:04:31.730
It could affect the body of our ship.

00:04:31.730 --> 00:04:33.390
We'll barely make it!

00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:35.960
We've gotta get the large ones
and pick up points.

00:04:36.700 --> 00:04:37.800
Do as you wish.

00:04:38.270 --> 00:04:40.140
Okay, she's mine!

00:04:40.140 --> 00:04:41.540
Outer shell forty-six percent melted.

00:04:42.310 --> 00:04:43.910
Sensor rod brought in.

00:04:43.910 --> 00:04:45.480
483 to target.

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:46.450
Huh?

00:04:46.650 --> 00:04:49.480
Number 12 is headed this way!
It's gonna be a near miss!

00:04:49.480 --> 00:04:50.480
Where?

00:04:50.480 --> 00:04:52.190
Rear portside, 332.

00:04:52.190 --> 00:04:53.650
All right, there.

00:04:55.890 --> 00:04:57.690
Turn it to auto! Protect our position!

00:04:57.690 --> 00:04:59.780
I know, I know! Huh?

00:05:00.260 --> 00:05:02.230
Number three is heading straight for us!

00:05:05.600 --> 00:05:07.190
Number twelve is falling into Geduld!

00:05:07.570 --> 00:05:12.100
<i>Our heat plug has melted,</i>
<i>We can no longer use our auto.</i>

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:17.540
Looks like game over for them.

00:05:17.540 --> 00:05:18.770
Kouji, let's give it another try.

00:05:19.350 --> 00:05:21.280
- I think we're too late.
- Why's that?

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:23.270
Number three got it before us.

00:05:24.120 --> 00:05:26.220
Attention all students in operating rooms...

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:29.490
...proceed to search pod retrieval.

00:05:29.490 --> 00:05:30.460
Roger.

00:05:30.960 --> 00:05:32.020
Roger.

00:05:32.490 --> 00:05:34.030
Operating room seven...

00:05:34.030 --> 00:05:37.330
...Kouji Aiba and Ikumi Oze
proceeding to pod retrieval.

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:41.670
Operating room eight, Albert Dazly and
Louis Beans proceeding to pod retrieval.

00:05:41.670 --> 00:05:45.230
Operating room twelve,
Sorry sir, we lost our unit.

00:05:47.640 --> 00:05:50.200
We've gotta try again, what a drag.

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:53.280
Level two licenses usually take seven tries.

00:05:53.280 --> 00:05:54.750
There's nothing to be depressed about.

00:05:57.380 --> 00:06:00.920
But I haven't got the money
to take this test over and over.

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:05.630
You paid your own way, Ikumi?
Aren't you rich, coming from Jupiter?

00:06:05.630 --> 00:06:07.820
I may not look it, but I'm pretty poor.

00:06:08.730 --> 00:06:11.360
Don't hate me 'cause I let my parents pay.

00:06:11.360 --> 00:06:13.060
That's okay, accept what you can get.

00:06:13.530 --> 00:06:15.500
You think so?

00:06:22.640 --> 00:06:24.310
I'll never get used to this.

00:06:24.310 --> 00:06:26.470
And this is just one-third G.

00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:34.890
Hey, Number seven team.

00:06:34.890 --> 00:06:36.560
Tried to bite off more than you can chew?

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:39.530
Stop laughing,
if you know what's good for you.

00:06:39.530 --> 00:06:43.900
We're trying for Level Two. You third
level guys oughta just keep quiet.

00:06:43.900 --> 00:06:47.230
Ikumi, you think you can get
your temporary license before the dive?

00:06:47.230 --> 00:06:49.070
Don't even ask.

00:06:49.070 --> 00:06:51.200
I knew we should've gone for a smaller one.

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:52.640
I'm sorry, satisfied?!

00:06:52.840 --> 00:06:53.840
Well, no, um.

00:06:53.840 --> 00:06:55.880
Wake up! We were lucky this time!

00:06:55.880 --> 00:06:57.910
If that was real, I'd never let you be so risky.

00:06:57.910 --> 00:07:00.250
Just do exactly what I say, got that?

00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:01.810
It's the Number Three guys.

00:07:01.810 --> 00:07:03.150
Them?

00:07:04.120 --> 00:07:06.350
Let go, you're stretching my shirt.

00:07:07.850 --> 00:07:10.980
I'm not done with you, don't you have
something to say?! Hey!

00:07:11.290 --> 00:07:12.450
Pardon me.

00:07:14.360 --> 00:07:18.020
If you just make a request
you can probably change partners.

00:07:18.770 --> 00:07:22.330
You don't have to stay with the guy
if you don't want to, right?

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:25.530
I know that!

00:07:29.980 --> 00:07:31.140
You know him?

00:07:31.140 --> 00:07:32.170
Not really.

00:07:40.820 --> 00:07:42.420
Main tank blow.

00:07:42.420 --> 00:07:43.490
Commencing blow.

00:07:43.490 --> 00:07:47.190
Switching to Level D3 anti-radiant rays.
Lowering TK shield for all hands.

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:50.290
Heat of outer wall rising, now at 560 anvils.

00:07:53.470 --> 00:07:57.630
Ship descending, 70, 50, 30,
entering Sere one.

00:07:58.400 --> 00:07:59.600
Protection levels all cleared.

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:08.140
Sere two, entered to 320.
Proceed to target point at 0.2 Herschels.

00:08:08.650 --> 00:08:12.880
Target point, Astronaut Training Center,
Liebe Delta.

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:23.130
Thanks for the music chip.

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:24.530
You like it?

00:08:24.530 --> 00:08:25.460
It's awful!

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:28.970
Give me something decent next time. Bye.

00:08:29.600 --> 00:08:30.570
Bye.

00:08:30.870 --> 00:08:31.900
Who's she?

00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:33.570
I think she was in one of my classes.

00:08:33.940 --> 00:08:34.940
I see.

00:08:34.940 --> 00:08:36.530
Sorry to keep you.

00:08:36.840 --> 00:08:37.970
What's with that outfit?

00:08:38.310 --> 00:08:41.850
Can't you tell?
It's part of our flight attendant training.

00:08:41.850 --> 00:08:46.880
Mr. E-328456 is lacking calcium,
so you get the F-set, plus 60.

00:08:47.220 --> 00:08:48.740
Thanks for the obvious sarcasm.

00:08:49.390 --> 00:08:51.580
We're watching out for your health.

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:52.910
Whatever.

00:08:55.460 --> 00:08:56.930
You don't expect me to eat all this?

00:08:57.100 --> 00:08:58.720
I told you, "plus 60".

00:09:01.030 --> 00:09:02.970
Kouji, is something bothering you?

00:09:03.370 --> 00:09:04.270
Why?

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:05.930
You've got that look on your face.

00:09:06.410 --> 00:09:09.240
No. Training didn't go very well.

00:09:09.510 --> 00:09:10.580
Really?

00:09:10.580 --> 00:09:11.540
Really!

00:09:12.380 --> 00:09:14.950
Right away.

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:15.810
Don't leave anything.

00:09:16.180 --> 00:09:17.980
Okay, already.

00:09:18.480 --> 00:09:20.080
What is it with her?

00:09:22.220 --> 00:09:24.020
What's wrong?

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:25.350
N-Nothing.

00:09:26.990 --> 00:09:29.390
Please understand, don't be upset, Pat.

00:09:30.360 --> 00:09:33.890
I'm glad that you came to see me,
but I'm busy until after the dive.

00:09:35.070 --> 00:09:36.000
Dive?

00:09:36.400 --> 00:09:39.030
This Liebe Delta is going into Geduld.

00:09:39.870 --> 00:09:40.710
It's falling?

00:09:40.710 --> 00:09:42.670
Don't worry, it's only temporary.

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:45.480
Our orbit takes us into Sere one.

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:49.020
We won't have access to most of our
image and communication devices.

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:52.080
So these training facilities will be closed.

00:09:52.520 --> 00:09:54.780
Then hurry and get the dive over with.

00:09:54.990 --> 00:09:56.450
Now you're being selfish.

00:09:57.220 --> 00:10:00.660
I'll play with you all you want
once I get some time off, okay?

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:01.630
Okay.

00:10:02.260 --> 00:10:04.230
Are the guys from Zwei there yet?

00:10:04.760 --> 00:10:06.890
<i>Yes, they're currently in a final briefing.</i>

00:10:07.670 --> 00:10:08.630
Good.

00:10:08.800 --> 00:10:10.770
We'll hold a navigation simulation,
as planned.

00:10:14.410 --> 00:10:17.870
Wow, look at the awesome environment
that the Zwei guys get to use.

00:10:18.740 --> 00:10:20.740
They're taking flight estimates of Geduld.

00:10:21.110 --> 00:10:24.450
They must be confident.
They're letting everyone see their training.

00:10:25.250 --> 00:10:26.840
Maybe they're proud to be aviation cadets.

00:10:27.150 --> 00:10:30.550
Perhaps. But only about half of them
are legitimate candidates.

00:10:31.390 --> 00:10:32.820
Oh look! See her?

00:10:33.890 --> 00:10:36.360
She got a scholarship for top spot here.

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:38.930
I hear she's famous among the girls.

00:10:40.570 --> 00:10:41.500
Smart huh?

00:10:41.500 --> 00:10:42.830
Hey, Ikumi!

00:10:43.100 --> 00:10:44.740
Oh, go ahead, I'm done.

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:45.930
Thank you.

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:48.260
No, that's not why I'm here.

00:10:49.140 --> 00:10:51.310
Are you going home for the dive holidays?

00:10:51.310 --> 00:10:54.350
Are you serious?
I haven't got the time or the money!

00:10:54.350 --> 00:10:55.310
Oh...

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:56.420
Kouji.

00:10:56.420 --> 00:10:57.580
Huh?

00:10:57.580 --> 00:10:59.550
You returning to earth?

00:10:59.820 --> 00:11:01.790
No, I don't think so.

00:11:02.320 --> 00:11:04.120
Maybe I'll stay here too.

00:11:04.660 --> 00:11:06.030
Why?

00:11:06.030 --> 00:11:09.120
What's with that tone? How annoying!

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:13.700
That's not what I meant.
If you wanna go home, then go.

00:11:13.700 --> 00:11:16.030
No way! I'm not going home!

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:18.570
What are you so upset about?

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:20.470
I've made up my mind!

00:11:20.470 --> 00:11:21.970
What I'm saying is...!

00:11:21.970 --> 00:11:22.940
Enough!

00:11:24.110 --> 00:11:25.140
What should I do?

00:11:25.140 --> 00:11:29.770
Sir. Not eating all your food
could affect grades.

00:11:30.620 --> 00:11:32.350
My grades, that is.

00:11:33.050 --> 00:11:34.750
I get the message.

00:11:51.240 --> 00:11:54.760
Now, it's time to make up for the past.

00:12:01.980 --> 00:12:03.920
Infinite Ryvius

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:08.920
Infinite Ryvius

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:14.090
We have simulated Liebe Delta's route
300 thousand times. All clear.

00:12:14.630 --> 00:12:15.760
All clear.

00:12:15.760 --> 00:12:17.300
Commencing phase one.

00:12:17.300 --> 00:12:18.730
All clear confirmed.

00:12:18.730 --> 00:12:19.990
Commencing phase 2.

00:12:20.570 --> 00:12:23.570
All green confirmed.
Commence phase 3.

00:12:23.570 --> 00:12:32.840
Commencing phase 3.
Seconds to purge, 5, 4, 3, 2, 1, purge!

00:12:45.160 --> 00:12:48.130
Commencing descent of all pillars
below the J-line.

00:12:52.470 --> 00:12:57.490
<i>As of noon today, this station will</i>
<i>commence its dive into Geduld.</i>

00:12:58.400 --> 00:13:04.170
<i>Please make any external calls now as</i>
<i>communication will be cut off.</i>

00:13:04.710 --> 00:13:08.910
<i>Repeating announcement.</i>
<i>As of noon today, this station...!</i>

00:13:08.910 --> 00:13:12.250
<i>You have one message. You have...</i>

00:13:12.250 --> 00:13:16.550
Oh boy, it's from Mom again.
She can be such a pest.

00:13:22.090 --> 00:13:24.490
There's no one here. I'm out.

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:28.000
What's the matter, Kouji?

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:29.200
I'm sleeping.

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:32.470
You're wasting your time off.
Where's Oze?

00:13:32.470 --> 00:13:34.800
I dunno. Izumi took him somewhere.

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:37.810
<i>I found this great place!</i>

00:13:37.810 --> 00:13:40.470
<i>I hear ya! Just let me get dressed!</i>

00:13:41.380 --> 00:13:42.970
I can imagine what happened.

00:13:43.620 --> 00:13:45.140
Why aren't you going home, Aoi?

00:13:45.750 --> 00:13:50.280
Traveling is too hectic. And besides,
your Mom is counting on me.

00:13:50.460 --> 00:13:52.010
Just ignore her.

00:13:53.130 --> 00:13:54.990
Yuki's staying too.

00:13:54.990 --> 00:13:56.120
Oh.

00:13:56.930 --> 00:14:00.630
You don't seem interested.
Are all brothers like this?

00:14:01.300 --> 00:14:04.200
It would be gross to be very close.

00:14:04.200 --> 00:14:05.810
On the other hand, I don't understand you.

00:14:05.810 --> 00:14:09.440
Wouldn't you rather not see
your childhood friends so much?

00:14:09.440 --> 00:14:09.970
Why's that?

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:12.710
Why? Well...

00:14:12.710 --> 00:14:16.240
Don't you find it un-cool to have
someone around who knows your past?

00:14:16.780 --> 00:14:18.440
You think about things like that?

00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:20.390
Sure I do.

00:14:20.390 --> 00:14:21.350
Here!

00:14:21.990 --> 00:14:23.360
What are you doing?

00:14:23.360 --> 00:14:26.790
You lack energy!
Let's go somewhere for a change of scene!

00:14:27.260 --> 00:14:28.160
Okay?

00:14:43.680 --> 00:14:46.150
What'll you do when you get your license?

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:48.110
I haven't decided on my future yet.

00:14:48.350 --> 00:14:49.540
What a boring life.

00:14:50.980 --> 00:14:52.010
Wow!

00:14:52.550 --> 00:14:56.490
It's gotta be fake. The cameras
wouldn't work this close to Geduld.

00:14:58.320 --> 00:15:01.090
You sure can take the fun outta things.

00:15:01.090 --> 00:15:02.190
But it's true.

00:15:02.190 --> 00:15:07.060
And the way you talk,
you used to be much more positive...

00:15:07.530 --> 00:15:08.500
Aoi!

00:15:08.670 --> 00:15:10.640
No. It failed again.

00:15:10.640 --> 00:15:12.100
Where's your confidence?!

00:15:12.270 --> 00:15:15.810
You know you'll be ridiculed if you can't
even get a training ship moving.

00:15:15.810 --> 00:15:18.330
Smaller ships are a lot easier to operate.

00:15:18.880 --> 00:15:22.580
Geduld may have something to do with it.
We'll finish our self-study session.

00:15:22.580 --> 00:15:25.650
I brought coffee,
oh, but am I interrupting?

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:27.890
No. It's okay, Juli.

00:15:27.890 --> 00:15:29.350
Excuse me.

00:15:29.620 --> 00:15:31.420
Can you please check the bypass?

00:15:31.420 --> 00:15:36.120
How dare you! Blaming me? Have you
no respect for your group leader?

00:15:36.560 --> 00:15:39.000
I'd say the S-23 should be bypassed...!

00:15:40.530 --> 00:15:42.440
What should we do about the bypass?

00:15:42.440 --> 00:15:43.930
Bypass S-23!

00:15:44.140 --> 00:15:46.760
Did you replace the outer wall data?

00:15:47.140 --> 00:15:49.330
The outer wall? Of the training ship?

00:15:49.710 --> 00:15:51.180
No, of Liebe Delta.

00:15:53.210 --> 00:15:54.280
What the...!

00:15:54.280 --> 00:15:56.370
Why are the numbers so high?

00:16:00.190 --> 00:16:02.020
You've gotta be outta your mind!

00:16:03.920 --> 00:16:06.720
See? They're arguing about something.

00:16:07.290 --> 00:16:09.590
You brought us here for this?

00:16:10.330 --> 00:16:14.390
Sorry if I startled you, but if you had
kept talking, they would've discovered us.

00:16:14.770 --> 00:16:18.290
<i>Yeah, but I feel like a fool</i>
<i>sitting here watching this.</i>

00:16:23.140 --> 00:16:24.610
What a spectacle.

00:16:25.240 --> 00:16:26.180
What's she thinking?

00:16:29.820 --> 00:16:32.720
Oh no! She's coming this way.

00:16:33.150 --> 00:16:34.120
Aoi.

00:16:38.790 --> 00:16:42.760
You don't get it, do you?
You don't know how great Yuki is!

00:16:42.760 --> 00:16:44.090
Does she always have to...?

00:16:44.300 --> 00:16:47.060
What? Were you spying on us?
That's disgusting.

00:16:48.670 --> 00:16:51.070
Sorry, sorry. She's emotionally unstable.

00:16:51.740 --> 00:16:53.430
Don't try to change the subject!

00:16:53.770 --> 00:16:55.070
You be quiet.

00:16:55.070 --> 00:16:56.440
You don't understand.

00:16:57.410 --> 00:17:01.000
I'm the one who was dumped.
He says he's growing tired of me.

00:17:01.880 --> 00:17:03.680
And why's Yuki such a great guy?

00:17:04.450 --> 00:17:05.520
W-Well, um...!

00:17:05.520 --> 00:17:06.490
Hey, get outta the way.

00:17:07.690 --> 00:17:09.780
It's against regulations to block the hall.

00:17:10.090 --> 00:17:11.350
Yes. Sorry, sir.

00:17:12.290 --> 00:17:13.780
We're on a different orbit?

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:16.150
Our instruments must be out of whack.

00:17:16.530 --> 00:17:17.960
Maybe it's the Geduld.

00:17:17.960 --> 00:17:22.830
However, if these numbers are correct,
then Liebe Delta is close to Sere 2.

00:17:23.070 --> 00:17:24.930
Sere 2? That's impossible!

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:27.200
Lucson! We should alert the control room!

00:17:27.540 --> 00:17:29.700
Right! Contact the control room!

00:17:29.980 --> 00:17:30.940
Okay!

00:17:32.210 --> 00:17:35.380
<i>Central control room.</i>
<i>This is Zwei in the Liebel.</i>

00:17:35.380 --> 00:17:39.020
<i>Central control room?</i>
<i>Can you hear me, central control room?</i>

00:17:39.020 --> 00:17:41.110
What's going on? I can't get through!

00:17:42.760 --> 00:17:46.210
Temperature of the outer wall is
continuing to rise! We've entered Sere 2!

00:17:46.630 --> 00:17:48.220
Check it one more time!

00:17:48.460 --> 00:17:53.630
Hurry! If it's right, then the center pillar
has already descended past our limit!

00:18:01.440 --> 00:18:02.370
What's that?

00:18:02.370 --> 00:18:03.240
An earthquake?

00:18:03.240 --> 00:18:04.710
Come on, we're in space!

00:18:07.350 --> 00:18:09.140
Hey, Blue. Are we shaking?

00:18:12.220 --> 00:18:13.750
What's gonna happen, Heigar?

00:18:13.750 --> 00:18:15.340
We're definitely off course.

00:18:16.020 --> 00:18:17.850
At this rate, the Liebe Delta will...

00:18:20.890 --> 00:18:22.860
...be crushed.

00:18:28.700 --> 00:18:29.800
Can't we override?

00:18:29.800 --> 00:18:32.710
I'm trying! I switched it to auto-balance!

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:34.430
Regardless, we've gotta warn everyone!

00:18:34.770 --> 00:18:36.740
Right! Use the internal PA system!

00:18:36.980 --> 00:18:38.580
It'll cause a panic!

00:18:38.580 --> 00:18:39.540
But...!

00:18:40.950 --> 00:18:42.970
Who in the world switched it?

00:18:49.620 --> 00:18:53.080
Hey, is the dive supposed to cause
such a tremor?

00:18:54.260 --> 00:18:55.760
What the hell are these numbers?

00:18:55.760 --> 00:18:57.350
Grahp readings are also increasing.

00:18:57.530 --> 00:18:59.200
What does this mean?

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:01.290
Maybe the outer wall broke somewhere.

00:19:01.800 --> 00:19:03.270
In this area?

00:19:04.970 --> 00:19:07.010
Someone's still in Area 31!

00:19:07.010 --> 00:19:10.030
You're kidding! You girls hurry
to the central area!

00:19:10.640 --> 00:19:11.480
Kouji!

00:19:11.480 --> 00:19:13.310
Get outta here! Now!

00:19:17.220 --> 00:19:18.780
I've got to save her.

00:19:18.780 --> 00:19:22.020
The instructors deserve to fail
for making it shake this badly.

00:19:22.020 --> 00:19:25.720
Calm down! Calm down!
We need to be calm, now more than ever!

00:19:25.720 --> 00:19:27.360
So what do you suggest we do?

00:19:27.360 --> 00:19:29.660
Well... Let's see...!

00:19:32.130 --> 00:19:33.100
Huh?

00:19:37.200 --> 00:19:39.260
I guess I was wrong about you.

00:19:39.440 --> 00:19:40.670
What do you mean?

00:19:40.670 --> 00:19:43.880
At times like this,
I thought you'd do nothing.

00:19:43.880 --> 00:19:46.570
Saving lives? We're taught it's top priority.

00:19:47.350 --> 00:19:48.750
So you're just following the manual?

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:50.450
Well why are <i>you</i> doing this?

00:19:50.450 --> 00:19:52.110
It's a terrible thing when people die.

00:19:54.390 --> 00:19:57.650
How can you be so frank about it?

00:19:59.960 --> 00:20:01.790
It's impossible, Aoi!

00:20:02.390 --> 00:20:06.500
Kouji's all talk and no action!
He's gonna fail!

00:20:06.500 --> 00:20:08.660
Don't be so sure of that.

00:20:08.970 --> 00:20:10.430
What are you two doing here?

00:20:19.510 --> 00:20:21.270
It's past here.

00:20:30.290 --> 00:20:31.120
Yuki!

00:20:31.560 --> 00:20:33.690
You need your brain checked, brother!

00:20:33.690 --> 00:20:34.660
Huh?

00:20:34.660 --> 00:20:37.500
You know how many grahps it'll go up,
if you open this?

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:39.160
There's someone on the other side!

00:20:39.570 --> 00:20:41.430
Why should I care?

00:20:41.430 --> 00:20:43.400
How could you say such a thing?

00:20:46.000 --> 00:20:47.710
We're not too late. Give us a hand.

00:20:47.710 --> 00:20:52.310
You can't save her, she'll die in agony
on the recovery bed anyway.

00:20:52.310 --> 00:20:53.780
What a horrendous thing to say!

00:20:54.410 --> 00:20:58.140
What makes you think you're so great?

00:20:59.180 --> 00:21:00.650
<i>We've located Liebe Delta.</i>

00:21:00.950 --> 00:21:04.590
After adjusting orbit calculations,
proceed to the number one contact point.

00:21:04.590 --> 00:21:07.250
We'll get Fox and the others with Bratica.

00:21:07.530 --> 00:21:11.090
Roger. Proceeding to the contact point
after adjusting orbit calculations.

00:21:14.200 --> 00:21:15.430
Damn you!

00:21:15.430 --> 00:21:16.840
Stop it!

00:21:16.840 --> 00:21:20.400
Yuki, this is no time to be fighting.
Think about it!

00:21:21.210 --> 00:21:24.510
You're the one who should be thinking!
Hell of a time to be Mr. Niceguy!

00:21:25.010 --> 00:21:29.040
We must save her! Why would <i>you,</i>
my brother, try to stop me?

00:21:29.580 --> 00:21:33.520
Can't you figure that out? You fool.

00:21:34.150 --> 00:21:36.780
That's exactly what I hate about you!

00:21:38.990 --> 00:21:40.960
What did you do that for?

00:21:41.660 --> 00:21:42.630
Yuki!

00:21:42.900 --> 00:21:44.860
You hypocrite!

00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:50.860
Always... always, always...!

00:21:56.280 --> 00:22:00.680
Why are you around, anyway?

00:22:03.820 --> 00:22:05.780
Just disappear!

00:22:10.140 --> 00:22:14.410
In your dry eyes...

00:22:14.410 --> 00:22:19.490
...a silhouette appears

00:22:19.490 --> 00:22:24.190
The blue colored future...

00:22:24.190 --> 00:22:30.290
...swayed and glittered

00:22:32.100 --> 00:22:40.340
Ah... No one wants...

00:22:40.340 --> 00:22:48.950
...freedom out of pity

00:22:48.950 --> 00:22:57.390
Ah... To the days I feared...

00:22:57.390 --> 00:23:01.290
...that I'd end up hurting someone,

00:23:01.290 --> 00:23:07.660
goodbye

00:23:11.660 --> 00:23:13.210
Infinite Ryvius

00:23:13.290 --> 00:23:16.890
Next episode: Unnecessary Things
When we were ordered to evacuate from
Liebe Delta to the exercise facilities...

00:23:16.890 --> 00:23:18.930
Next episode: Unnecessary Things
...I understood something.

00:23:18.930 --> 00:23:22.470
Next episode: Unnecessary Things
The moment you want to survive strongly
enough to sacrifice the lives of others...

00:23:22.470 --> 00:23:25.270
Next episode: Unnecessary Things
...kindness becomes hypocrisy.

00:23:25.270 --> 00:23:31.280
Next episode: Unnecessary Things
But even after realizing how unnecessary
my actions were... I'd probably... I'd...!

00:23:31.280 --> 00:23:31.740
Next episode: Unnecessary Things
